 <activities>
  <activity class="@associations.SimpleAssociation" name="caracteristicas" code="">
   <description />
   <messages>
    <cell type="initial">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="20" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0x003300" background="0xFFFFCC" />
     </style>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="cons_caracteristicas.mp3" />
     <p>Uní cada característica con sí es leyenda o no es leyenda.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell avoidOverlapping="true" image="i01-bienhecho.jpg" type="final">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="24" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0xFFFFFF" background="0x006600" />
     </style>
     <p>¡Muy bien!</p>
    </cell>
   </messages>
   <settings margin="8" report="true" reportActions="false">
    <container bgColor="0xC0C0C0">
     <gradient source="0x663300" dest="0xFFFFFF" angle="0" />
     <image name="fondo_aldea.png" tiled="true" />
     <counters time="true" actions="true" score="true" />
    </container>
    <window bgColor="0xC0C0C0" transparent="true" border="true" />
   </settings>
   <cells rows="4" cols="1" cellWidth="374.0" cellHeight="90.0" border="true" id="primary">
    <style margin="4" borderStroke="0.7" markerStroke="5.0">
     <font family="Arial" size="36" bold="true" />
     <color foreground="0x003366" background="0xFFFFFF" inactive="0xFFFFFF" />
    </style>
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="4" />
    <cell>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="caract_si1.mp3" />
     <p>Narra hechos sobrenaturales o naturales.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="caract_si2.mp3" />
     <p>Se transmite de generación en generación.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="caract_no1.mp3" />
     <p>Tiene un autor conocido.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="caract_no2.mp3" />
     <p>Termina siempre con una moraleja.</p>
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <cells rows="4" cols="1" cellWidth="200.0" cellHeight="90.0" border="true" id="secondary">
    <style borderStroke="0.7" markerStroke="5.0">
     <font family="Arial" size="22" bold="true" />
     <color foreground="0x006600" background="0xEEFFEE" inactive="0xFFFFFF" />
    </style>
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="4" />
    <cell>
     <p>✓ SÍ es leyenda</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <p>✓ SÍ es leyenda</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <p>✗ NO es leyenda</p>
    </cell>
    <cell>
     <p>✗ NO es leyenda</p>
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <scramble times="31" primary="true" secondary="false" />
   <layout position="AB" />
  </activity>
