    <cell imgAlign="right,middle" avoidOverlapping="true" image="vineta6.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vineta6.mp3" />
     <p>Pirayú pidió ayuda al Sol con toda su fuerza.</p>
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <scramble times="31" />
   <layout position="AB" />
  </activity>
  <activity class="@puzzles.DoublePuzzle" name="secuencia_3" code="">
   <description />
   <messages>
    <cell type="initial">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="22" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0x003366" background="0xCCFFFF" />
     </style>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="cons_secuencia3.mp3" />
     <p>Ordená las viñetas del final.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell avoidOverlapping="true" image="i01-bienhecho.jpg" type="final">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="24" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0xFFFFFF" background="0x006600" />
     </style>
     <p>¡Muy bien!</p>
    </cell>
   </messages>
   <settings margin="8" dragCells="true" report="true" reportActions="false">
    <container bgColor="0xC0C0C0">
     <gradient source="0x664400" dest="0xFFFFFF" angle="0" />
     <image name="fondo_girasol.png" tiled="true" />
     <counters time="true" actions="true" score="true" />
    </container>
    <window bgColor="0xC0C0C0" transparent="true" border="true" />
   </settings>
   <cells rows="3" cols="1" cellWidth="380.0" cellHeight="185.0" border="true">
    <style margin="4" borderStroke="0.7" markerStroke="5.0">
     <font family="Arial" size="20" bold="true" />
     <color foreground="0x003366" background="0xFFFFFF" inactive="0xFFFFFF" />
    </style>
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="3" />
    <cell imgAlign="right,middle" avoidOverlapping="true" image="vineta7.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vineta7.mp3" />
     <p>El Sol envolvió a la niña en una luz muy brillante.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell imgAlign="right,middle" avoidOverlapping="true" image="vineta8.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vineta8.mp3" />
     <p>Las nubes enviadas por el Sol trajeron lluvia a la aldea.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell imgAlign="right,middle" avoidOverlapping="true" image="vineta9.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vineta9.mp3" />
     <p>Donde Carandai había estado, nació un hermoso girasol que siempre mira al sol.</p>
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <scramble times="31" />
   <layout position="AB" />
  </activity>
  <activity class="@textGrid.WordSearch" name="sopa_leyenda" code="">
   <description />
   <messages>
    <cell type="initial">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="20" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0xFFFFFF" background="0x1A3A1A" />
     </style>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="cons_sopa.mp3" />
     <p>Encontrá: PIRAYÚ - MANDIÓ - CARANDAI - SOL - GIRASOL</p>
    </cell>
    <cell avoidOverlapping="true" image="i01-bienhecho.jpg" type="final">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="26" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0xFFFFFF" background="0x1A3A1A" />
     </style>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="i01-muy_bien.mp3" />
     <p>¡Muy bien!</p>
    </cell>
   </messages>
   <settings margin="8" report="true" reportActions="false">
    <helpWindow showSolution="true" />
    <container bgColor="0x1A3A1A">
     <gradient source="0x2A5A2A" dest="0x0A1A0A" angle="0" />
     <image name="portada-resized.jpg" tiled="true" />
     <counters time="true" actions="true" score="true" />
    </container>
    <window bgColor="0x000099" border="true" />
   </settings>
   <textGrid rows="10" columns="10" cellWidth="44.0" cellHeight="44.0" border="true">
    <style margin="2">
     <font family="Arial" size="20" bold="true" />
     <color foreground="0xFFFF00" background="0x1A3A1A" />
    </style>
    <text>
     <row>PIRAYU***C</row>
     <row>T*W*Z****A</row>
     <row>**MANDIO*R</row>
     <row>G*K*B****A</row>
     <row>I*X*M****N</row>
     <row>R*P*SOL**D</row>
     <row>A*Q*K****A</row>
     <row>S*W*R****I</row>
     <row>O*X*Y*Z***</row>
     <row>L*Y*Z*****</row>
    </text>
   </textGrid>
   <clues>
    <clue id="0">PIRAYU</clue>
    <clue id="1">MANDIO</clue>
    <clue id="2">CARANDAI</clue>
    <clue id="3">SOL</clue>
    <clue id="4">GIRASOL</clue>
   </clues>
   <cells rows="5" cols="1" cellWidth="120.0" cellHeight="120.0" border="true" id="secondary">
    <style />
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="5" />
    <cell image="img_pirayu.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="nom_pirayu.mp3" />
    </cell>
    <cell image="img_mandio.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="nom_mandio.mp3" />
    </cell>
    <cell image="img_carandai.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="nom_carandai.mp3" />
    </cell>
    <cell image="img_el_sol.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="nom_el_sol.mp3" />
    </cell>
    <cell image="img_girasol.png">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="nom_el_girasol.mp3" />
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <layout position="AB" />
  </activity>
  <activity class="@panels.Identify" name="verdadero_falso" code="">
   <description />
   <messages>
    <cell type="initial">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="20" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0x003300" background="0xFFFFCC" />
     </style>
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="cons_verdadero_falso.mp3" />
     <p>Pulsá sobre la afirmación verdadera.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell avoidOverlapping="true" image="i01-bienhecho.jpg" type="final">
     <style>
      <font family="Arial" size="24" bold="true" />
      <color foreground="0xFFFFFF" background="0x006600" />
     </style>
     <p>¡Muy bien!</p>
    </cell>
   </messages>
   <settings margin="8" report="true" reportActions="false">
    <container bgColor="0xC0C0C0">
     <gradient source="0x003300" dest="0xFFFFFF" angle="0" />
     <image name="fondo_girasol.png" tiled="true" />
     <counters time="true" actions="true" score="true" />
    </container>
    <window bgColor="0xC0C0C0" transparent="true" border="true" />
   </settings>
   <cells rows="3" cols="1" cellWidth="520.0" cellHeight="95.0" border="true" id="primary">
    <style margin="4" borderStroke="0.7" markerStroke="5.0">
     <font family="Arial" size="36" bold="true" />
     <color background="0xFFFFFF" />
     <gradient source="0xFFCCCC" dest="0xFFFFFF" angle="0" />
    </style>
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="3" />
    <cell id="0">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vf_falso1.mp3" />
     <p>La leyenda fue escrita por un autor guaraní conocido.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell id="1">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vf_verdadero.mp3" />
     <p>La leyenda explica el origen del girasol.</p>
    </cell>
    <cell id="0">
     <media type="PLAY_AUDIO" level="1" file="vf_falso2.mp3" />
     <p>El Sol castigó a Pirayú por pedir ayuda.</p>
    </cell>
   </cells>
   <cells rows="3" cols="1" cellWidth="50.0" cellHeight="30.0" border="true" id="solvedPrimary">
    <style />
    <shaper class="@Rectangular" cols="1" rows="3" />
    <cell />
    <cell image="i01-bienhecho.jpg" />
    <cell />
   </cells>
   <scramble times="31" primary="true" />
  </activity>
 </activities>
